sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>DashboardPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewDesignerDashboardBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewDesignerDashboardController
  participant ProjectView as «entity»<br/>ProjectView
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant Enquiry as «entity»<br/>Enquiry
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: a dashboard of total views, shortlists and enquiries
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/dashboard (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId)
  C->>ProjectView: totalForDesigner()
  ProjectView->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectView: rows
  ProjectView-->>C: result
  C->>Favourite: shortlistTotalForDesigner()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>C: result
  C->>Enquiry: countForDesigner()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C-->>B: DashboardResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result